{0E}"I mean, clothes that are all fluffy and frilly
are just so exciting...{0F}
So I thought, I'll become Safi..."{w}

{0E}"...Sigh, oh well, can't be helped...
Oh, I know!{0F}
So what do you think of this outfit? Exciting, right!?"{w}{p}"Ta-daa!{w}It's Exciting Safi!"{w}

{0E}"Oh, but as for Mom...
not a w-o-r-d, okay?{0F}
Tee hee hee."{w}

"Welcome! Oh, it's you, everyone!
Thanks so much for the Blue Rain!
Thanks to you, I get excited every single night!"{w}

{0E}"Welcome!
Toner is out at the moment~!{0F}
Tee hee!"{w}

"Who goes there!?{w}Oh, it's you lot."{w}{p}"Seeking an audience with Her Majesty
at this hour of the night...
have you no sense of decency!?"{w}

"For that, I would first like
your permission to tell them
about the magic airship, would you suppose!"{w}
